font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1X2</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3800000000000001; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mix Parlay</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3800000000000001; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Handicap</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3800000000000001; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Over/Under</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3800000000000001; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Odd/Even</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3800000000000001; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Outright</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3800000000000001; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Correct Score</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3800000000000001; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Dan masih banyak lagi lainnya.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"> </p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3800000000000001; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Akhir Kata</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3800000000000001; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Demikian informasi yang bisa kami sampaikan terkait BOLASLOT21 sebagai situs judi </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">sportbook </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">dan slot </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">online </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">paling populer di Indonesia. Seperti yang sudah kami jelaskan di atas, BOLASLOT21 ini memanglah telah menyediakan berbagai pilihan </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">game </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">menarik dengan kualitas </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">internasional</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">. Sehingga, para </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">player </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">yang bermain di situs BOLASLOT21 ini akan mendapatkan sensasi permainan yang berbeda.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"> </p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3800000000000001; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Disamping itu, BOLASLOT21 ini juga telah memberikan sarana tempat bermain yang mudah. Dimana, Anda bisa mengunjungi dan mengakses nya berbagai permainannya melalui genggaman tangan saja. Tentunya, hal tersebut juga telah memungkinkan Anda untuk bisa bermain dimana saja dan kapan saja melalui </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">smartphone </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">atau perangkat komputer yang terhubung dengan </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">internet</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p> </p>\";s:10:\"occupation\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"active\";s:18:\"is_email_confirmed\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"is_mention_muted\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"fields\";s:110:\"{\"facebook\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"\",\"vkontakte\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"\",\"telegram\":\"\",\"skype\":\"\"}\";s:4:\"name\";s:10:\"Registered\";s:4:\"cans\";s:527:\"a:36:{s:2:\"mf\";i:0;s:2:\"ms\";i:0;s:2:\"mt\";i:0;s:2:\"mp\";i:0;s:3:\"mth\";i:0;s:2:\"vm\";i:0;s:3:\"aum\";i:0;s:2:\"em\";i:0;s:3:\"vmg\";i:0;s:3:\"aup\";i:1;s:4:\"vmem\";i:1;s:9:\"view_stat\";i:1;s:4:\"vprf\";i:1;s:4:\"vpra\";i:1;s:4:\"vprs\";i:0;s:2:\"bm\";i:0;s:2:\"dm\";i:0;s:3:\"upc\";i:1;s:3:\"upa\";i:1;s:3:\"ups\";i:1;s:2:\"va\";i:1;s:3:\"vmu\";i:0;s:3:\"vmm\";i:0;s:3:\"vmt\";i:1;s:4:\"vmct\";i:1;s:3:\"vmr\";i:1;s:3:\"vmw\";i:1;s:4:\"vmsn\";i:1;s:4:\"vmrd\";i:1;s:3:\"vml\";i:1;s:3:\"vmo\";i:1;s:3:\"vms\";i:1;s:4:\"vmam\";i:1;s:4:\"vwpm\";i:1;s:3:\"caa\";i:1;s:12:\"vt_add_topic\";i:1;}\";s:11:\"description\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"utitle\";s:10:\"Registered\";s:4:\"role\";s:10:\"subscriber\";s:6:\"access\";s:8:\"standard\";s:5:\"color\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"secondary\";s:1:\"1\";s:10:\"is_default\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"umeta_id\";s:3:\"325\";s:7:\"user_id\";s:2:\"13\";s:8:\"meta_key\";s:9:\"last_name\";s:10:\"meta_value\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"group_name\";s:10:\"Registered\";s:11:\"group_color\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"first_name\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"last_name\";s:0:\"\";}');
