(52, 0, 2, 14, 18, 'Excellent clues as to its date and place of origin', '<p>The statue\'s decorations and artwork provide excellent clues as to its date and place of origin. The statue appears to have a certain style and design that corresponds to the time period in which it was created. For instance, a design from the 17th century with a simple body and less ornamentation is more noticeable than one from the 19th century with intricate carvings. Age may also be determined by looking at the materials used to build the statue, such as brass, copper, or bronze.</p>', '2023-03-13 08:55:55', '2023-03-13 08:55:55', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, '', '', 0, -1),
